  "id": "irreversible-coma",
  "term": "irreversible coma",
  "definition": "Irreversible coma is a clinical state described as having no realistic chance of recovery. In the context of advance care planning, it is one of the conditions in which a person may choose in advance to forgo life-sustaining treatment or artificial nutrition and hydration.",
